cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the thesis What activation patching shows (Chapter 3, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24555440) and this repository."
title: "How donors are chosen and combined changes activation-patching conclusions: code and results"
abstract: "Measures when the way activation-patching donors are combined (mean or resample ablation) and what they contain changes a patching analysis's conclusions in GPT-2 Small, Qwen3-0.6B and Qwen3-1.7B: the gap between the two methods, the sites a patching sweep flags, an ablated circuit's agreement with the model's errors, and the same questions for single attention heads and other components."
authors:
